# P0-7: toolbar tooltip appears only after ~0.5s of steady hover, in
# Win95 style (pale yellow #FFFFE1, 1px black border, 4px/2px padding).
# Print Preview button center is (110, 76) at 1280x720 / ui_scale 1.2;
# the tooltip lands just below it at about y=92. (79, 76) was the old
# coordinate: it lands in the 1px gap between buttons, so no tooltip
# ever appeared in the after-delay screenshot.
mouse_move 110 76
wait_frames 6
screenshot p0_tooltip_before_delay
wait_frames 900
screenshot p0_tooltip_after_delay
